; unit-cpuparticles2d-curves.tscn with both Curves in a .tres: the one variable is where the curves are stored.
; Every parameter slot is `lerp(min, max, random) * curve(age)`. `scale_amount` grows then collapses
; and `angle` sweeps, both through a Curve, so the steady-state emitter shows each curve: one
; particle per age.

